  /// included 2. The average cart size is 2.5 products = (3+2)/2. This metric
  /// is only available if you report conversions with cart data.
  core.double? averageCartSize;

  /// The average amount you pay per interaction.
  ///
  /// This amount is the total cost of your ads divided by the total number of
  /// interactions.
  core.double? averageCost;

  /// The total cost of all clicks divided by the total number of clicks
