  /// characters include 0123456789-$:/.+ and optional start and end guards from
  /// ABCD.
  /// - "CODE39" : Code 39 1D format. Max 8 characters and no links. Supported
  /// characters include 0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ-. *$/+%.
