  /// check digit will be computed automatically) or 13 digits (if you are
  /// providing your own check digit).
  /// - "ITF" : ITF (Interleaved Two of Five) 1D format. Must be 14 digits long
  /// - "PDF417" : PDF417 format. Max 140 characters and no links
  /// - "UPC_A" : UPC-A 1D format. The barcode value should be 11 digits (the
  /// check digit will be computed automatically) or 12 digits (if you are
  /// providing your own check digit).
  core.String? type;

